# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large artifacts
#
# NOTE: data/, models/, checkpoints/, mlruns/ and mlflow.db are ALREADY tracked
# in this repo -- that is why .git is 245MB and why the GPU box needed a
# --depth 1 clone. Listing them here stops NEW ones being added; it does not
# untrack the existing files (gitignore only applies to untracked paths).
#
# Untracking them is a separate, history-rewriting decision. If you want it:
#   git rm -r --cached data models checkpoints mlruns mlflow.db
#   git commit -m "stop tracking large artifacts"
# That leaves the files on disk and drops them from FUTURE commits, but the
# 245MB stays in history until the history itself is rewritten (git-filter-repo).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
models/
checkpoints/
mlruns/
mlflow.db
*.pt
*.pkl
